    "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Your infection is a ravenous, bloodthirsty monster, yearning to break free. You struggle to keep it in check, placated or distracted, else the desire for carnage and mayhem overwhelms you.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Negative Trait (Choose one): </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Mental Disorder (ADHD, Anxiety, or PTSD)<br /></span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Free Sleight (Choose One): </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">High Pain Threshold, Burst of Adrenaline, or Psychic Stab</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Other Potential Enhanced Behaviors: </span><span class=\"fontstyle1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Arousal, Gluttony, Risk-Taking.<br /></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Other Potential Restricted Behaviors:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Empathy.<br /></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Other Potential Motivations:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">+Cannibalism, +Claim Territory, +Eradicate Enemies, +Instill Fear, +Stalk Prey.</span></p>",
